	measure 'Female UR at Peak Participation' = ```
			
					VAR _peak = [Female LFPR Peak]
					VAR _epr = [Female EPR]
					RETURN IF ( NOT ISBLANK ( _epr ), DIVIDE ( _peak - _epr, _peak ) * 100 )
			```
		formatString: 0.0\%
